title: "AI Driven Cyber Deception in FinTech: An Adaptive Defense Strategy"
abstract: >-
  An Adaptive Deception Defense Framework (ADDF) that orchestrates AI-driven
  honeypots, honeytokens and decoy micro-services within live FinTech workflows,
  using a recurrent-neural threat profiler and a Proximal-Policy-Optimization
  agent to misdirect attackers while harvesting threat intelligence.
